<mxCell id="ket" value="&lt;b&gt;Keterangan&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Ungu = antarmuka (menu.py), biru = manager (aturan bisnis), oranye = repository (SQL), kuning = infrastruktur, hijau = model.&lt;br&gt;Panah terbuka = asosiasi (atribut). Garis putus-putus = dependensi. Segitiga kosong = generalisasi (pewarisan). Belah ketupat penuh = komposisi.&lt;br&gt;Garis bawah = member static/class; huruf miring = abstrak. + publik, # dipakai subclass, - privat.&lt;br&gt;Hanya Database yang memanggil connect/execute/commit/rollback; SQL hanya ada di app.repository. Manager memakai model dan menangkap DatabaseError; repository memakai Database lewat atribut db.&lt;br&gt;Modul pendukung (bukan class): config.py (baca .env), validasi.py, konstanta.py." style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#bdbdbd;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingRight=8;spacingTop=6;fontSize=11;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1390" y="70" width="440" height="175" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
<mxCell id="judul" value="UML Class Diagram Implementasi (versi MySQL) - Sistem Pengelolaan Peminjaman Peralatan Laboratorium (Kelompok 2)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=16;fontStyle=1;fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="8" width="1300" height="24" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
</root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
